    "# Credit Risk Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**AuditLend Intelligence Core (ALICe)**  \n",
    "Statistical thinking foundation for credit risk modeling.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objectives\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Population Overview** — Understand the Lending Club corpus: volume, default rates, time ranges.\n",
    "2. **Default Rate Patterns** — Vintage analysis by grade, sub_grade, purpose.\n",
    "3. **WOE/IV Analysis** — Quantify predictive power of key features (dti, revol_util, annual_inc, int_rate).\n",
    "4. **PSI Analysis** — Measure population stability across train/validation/test splits.\n",
    "5. **Hypothesis Testing** — Statistical significance tests for categorical and numeric differences.\n",
    "6. **Correlation Structure** — Feature collinearity and relationship to target.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Prerequisites\n",
    "\n",
    "Set `LENDING_CLUB_DATA_PATH` to point to the Lending Club CSV:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "export LENDING_CLUB_DATA_PATH=\"ml/data/raw/accepted_2007_to_2018Q4.csv.gz\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Dependencies: pandas, numpy, scipy, matplotlib, seaborn, optbinning (optional), lifelines (for survival)."
   ]
